  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco's Tactical Athletic Fit T-Shirt is expertly designed to offer both durability and comfort during rigorous activities. Engineered with an athletic fit, it boasts slightly smaller chest, armholes, and sleeve openings for a sleek appearance that complements your physique.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "132788",
  "description": "<p>Rothco's Tactical Athletic Fit T-Shirt is expertly designed to offer both durability and comfort during rigorous activities. Engineered with an athletic fit, it boasts slightly smaller chest, armholes, and sleeve openings for a sleek appearance that complements your physique. The shirt's moisture-wicking ring-spun polyester fabric efficiently absorbs perspiration, ensuring you stay cool and dry even during intense workouts or outdoor adventures. Featuring a loop field on the left sleeve, measuring 3.5 inch x 2.36 inch, this tee offers a convenient space for attaching morale patches or branch tape, allowing you to showcase your personal style or affiliations. On the right sleeve, a distinctive reverse distressed US flag print adds a patriotic touch to the shirt's design. Additionally, the tagless label and inset collar enhance comfort, preventing irritation and ensuring a comfortable wear experience throughout the day. Ideal for athletes, outdoor enthusiasts, and anyone seeking a high-performance t-shirt with a stylish edge.</p>",
